<!doctype html><html lang="en"><head><meta charset="utf-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1"><meta name="robots" content="noindex,nofollow"><title>Optional practice support</title><base href="/api/v1/course-tests/chinese-1/a/file/"><link rel="stylesheet" href="paper.css"></head><body><main><header class="hero"><p class="eyebrow">HSKKit · Chinese 1 Course Review · Original Paper A</p><h1>Optional practice support</h1><p>40 listening/reading questions + 4 writing/speaking tasks. Independent course-review draft.</p><p class="note">Printable materials and answer references. Open the workspace to practise with section clocks and local recording. Writing and speaking need manual review.</p><nav class="links"><a href="index.html">Overview</a><a href="student.html">Learner paper</a><a href="teacher.html">Answers &amp; scripts</a><a href="listening.html">Listen to Paper A</a><a href="student.pdf">Learner PDF</a><a href="student-traditional.pdf">繁體 PDF</a><a href="teacher.pdf">Answer PDF</a></nav></header><section class="box"><p>This optional preparation list is not part of the timed paper. Using it during an attempt changes the support condition.</p><table><tr><th>Chinese</th><th>Pinyin</th><th>Meaning</th></tr><tr><td class="cn">铅笔</td><td>qiānbǐ</td><td>pencil</td></tr><tr><td class="cn">钢笔</td><td>gāngbǐ</td><td>pen</td></tr><tr><td class="cn">教室</td><td>jiàoshì</td><td>classroom</td></tr><tr><td class="cn">图书馆</td><td>túshūguǎn</td><td>library</td></tr><tr><td class="cn">办公室</td><td>bàngōngshì</td><td>office</td></tr><tr><td class="cn">食堂</td><td>shítáng</td><td>school canteen</td></tr><tr><td class="cn">衬衫</td><td>chènshān</td><td>shirt</td></tr><tr><td class="cn">小号</td><td>xiǎohào</td><td>small size</td></tr><tr><td class="cn">外套</td><td>wàitào</td><td>coat</td></tr><tr><td class="cn">厚</td><td>hòu</td><td>thick</td></tr><tr><td class="cn">薄</td><td>báo</td><td>thin</td></tr><tr><td class="cn">帽子</td><td>màozi</td><td>hat</td></tr><tr><td class="cn">橙子</td><td>chéngzi</td><td>orange</td></tr><tr><td class="cn">公共汽车</td><td>gōnggòng qìchē</td><td>bus</td></tr></table></section></main></body></html>